# warnings

## INVALID_OPTION

```text
[INVALID_OPTION] `preserveEntrySignatures: 'allow-extension'` is set implicitly by Rolldown

- `codeSplitting.includeDependenciesRecursively = false` requires `preserveEntrySignatures` to be either `false` or 'allow-extension'

To fix:

- Set `preserveEntrySignatures` either to `false` or 'allow-extension' in your config

```

# Assets

## a.js

```js
import "./peer.js";
// a.js
globalThis.minShareCountLog.push("a");
const load = () => Promise.all([import("./lazy.js"), import("./other.js")]);
export { load };

```

## b.js

```js
import "./peer.js";
// b.js
globalThis.minShareCountLog.push("b");

```

## lazy.js

```js
import { t as token } from "./shared.js";
// lazy.js
const value = token[0];
export { value };

```

## other.js

```js
import { t as value } from "./vendor.js";
// other.js
const other = value;
export { other };

```

## peer.js

```js
import { t as value } from "./vendor.js";
// peer.js
globalThis.minShareCountLog.push(`peer:${value}`);

```

## shared.js

```js
// shared.js
let token = ["ok"];
export { token as t };

```

## vendor.js

```js
import { t as token } from "./shared.js";
// vendor.js
const value = token[0];
export { value as t };

```
